      "text": "Look: white ground, ink #0F172A, UltraStore blue #2563EB from the app icon, Manrope display over Inter body, 20 px card radius, pill buttons. Real ULTRA OS app icons and versions; prices, sizes and dates beyond the UltraVideo example in Docs/UltraStore/README.md are sample data marked [PRICE] where unknown. No star ratings: the catalog has none yet.",
